WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.592
This example writes the running-total frame explicitly.

00:00:03.592 --> 00:00:11.187
The meaning is simple: start with the first row in the ordered partition and continue through the current row.

00:00:11.187 --> 00:00:15.607
Writing the frame explicitly makes the analytical rule visible.

00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:20.368
A future reader does not have to guess whether the default behavior was intentional.
